      <p class="font-sans font-normal text-sm leading-relaxed text-black/85">
        Learn from the ground up with a structured, mentor-guided approach. Progress from fundamental concepts to advanced skills through interactive learning experiences, expert reviews, and hands-on projects that prepare you for real industry demands.
      </p>

